Description: OpenTelemetry Python ASGI instrumentation
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package provides automatic instrumentation for ASGI applications
 (e.g. Starlette, FastAPI) so that incoming requests are traced without
 code changes to the application.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
